 Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"XwpjTjy_jwWGAlG_rt1Hrg","review_id":"BzmZM22jsNqwZJHDq6iOvA","date":"2018-08-06T00:55:35","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9254195690155029,"text_excerpt":"This place is delicious! We came here with a group of 8 for breakfast on a whim, and we all left fully satisfied (not always easy with 8 people). There is lots of seating in the back, and we had the little back room to ourselves. It was super cozy and felt like we were enjoying an insanely good home cooked meal in the comfort of our home. I personally recommend the spinach and feta breakfast sandwich and their teas. They have loose leaf tea and made my friend a green tea mint blend, which she enjoyed. Fatma was very sweet too! Thank you for a lovely meal."},{"business_id":"XwpjTjy_jwWGAlG_rt1Hrg","review_id":"XIceN6RgbNL_m9Or1eiUSA","date":"2018-05-31T02:14:02","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9199084639549255,"text_excerpt":"I stop into Fatma's every few weekends and I can't say I ever tire of their simplicity yet freshly delicious food and coffee. The baklava is the best I've had in town! If the space itself or the friendly staff don't make you happy when you walk in, the \"eye candy\" in the bathroom will give you something to smile about, haha!"},{"business_id":"XwpjTjy_jwWGAlG_rt1Hrg","review_id":"Vg11YZuqvWzF056rIHwS-g","date":"2019-08-05T16:27:01","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9171380400657654,"text_excerpt":"The cutest cafe ever! It felt cozy. People came in who obviously frequent the place and it made it feel like home. Everyone who worked there was extremely friendly and helpful. I can't believe I hadn't been here before when its so close to where I used to live. There's couches in the front and there's tables in the back. There's a lot of space and it would be a great place to read or do some work. I got an iced coffee with soy milk and shared hummus and pita with my friend. It was delicious hummus and presented beautifully. It's a coffee shop I would definitely return to! The sandwiches that some other people got were drool worthy and I wished I had been hungrier to try one. I will have t..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"XwpjTjy_jwWGAlG_rt1Hrg","photo_id":"cjDvCWpYsxeHQpQzy3kLWw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/cjDvCWpYsxeHQpQzy3kLWw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8946484923362732},{"business_id":"XwpjTjy_jwWGAlG_rt1Hrg","photo_id":"JhcsfGRkZj4Jg6E7w80y4A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/JhcsfGRkZj4Jg6E7w80y4A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8699026107788086},{"business_id":"XwpjTjy_jwWGAlG_rt1Hrg","photo_id":"LFr_4Kl3-7iuqETjF-DRqg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/LFr_4Kl3-7iuqETjF-DRqg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8261400461196899},{"business_id":"XwpjTjy_jwWGAlG_rt1Hrg","photo_id":"34JoVcASy85w4jf_7d5knQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/34JoVcASy85w4jf_7d5knQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7864270806312561},{"business_id":"XwpjTjy_jwWGAlG_rt1Hrg","photo_id":"dZzRGiAOWt7-AXgKRpHp8Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/dZzRGiAOWt7-AXgKRpHp8Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7800247669219971}]},"notebook_case":null}
